FINAL ANSWER:
**Short answer:** Ask Graham Campbell about `Lexer.php`. Ask Aiko Tanaka about the escape handling. Both are active. Everything below comes from `git blame -w -M -C` at HEAD (2026-08-26).

**`src/Parser` overall (1,187 surviving lines, 10 files, 41 non-merge commits)**

| Author | Lines | Share | Commits | Share |
